": "MatchBallSummary.png", "id": "1638389723816917", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619159_1638389727150250_8382860795276924990_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xcv6Kv6nkOwQ7kNvwEiVcHp&_nc_oc=Ado1fpeED6l4d29Tlaq9zoINSQC6tjDD9sKyQ14wu54gWiUEUWF4TpvxQmhtwha0WGw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af71y7df4NVEhTi4czKHiiOa0mDLDY7e3m--8knqYXxJzQ&oe=6A0C57BA"}, {"file_name": "iBC_MetaStore_PracticeNets.png", "id": "1997066457684856", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499617729_1997066461018189_5347482304155223925_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=B5JNTHh53jEQ7kNvwFrwPjl&_nc_oc=Adp200Cb2rVWDAp9LGK7kbkVGdjv3gJNXf4q6lA1bTcyRDTnM5AimUq7-ctmv0oTipM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4tw8kDszLV3jwgycIp0e1XHRbPvQ8mBg9JHrubsa-ZEw&oe=6A0C7C8B"}, {"file_name": "CampaignMode.png", "id": "621412579727793", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75572758_621412583061126_6110164533952850496_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5O0qjX3s_q0Q7kNvwHB8iSc&_nc_oc=AdofAPFhykdoTTSLvHg_aZkJTds5095R_i5s2pMXiF2Gj74qCNlXS5QMxmK6IQidJ6A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6jbu5fqkwhj6Nb24H6cbLRoALl6adRO3-rDlrlpVastA&oe=6A0C5B5F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer_CoverImage.png", "id": "1625673865327483", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619680_1625673868660816_2245971814992238208_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nWD7RzPRXXAQ7kNvwEx3645&_nc_oc=AdrAadO0bnYFJVvisB-5nnOrdKRzHjKZuaVjxGu6kwYAJQ1UXFOEXnGJaye9MCecEmo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5wf38lBR_tt9heMoMuXcfQGoF8rlKeLrL-GWvFC9bPKg&oe=6A0C7319"}, "display_name": "iB Cricket", "keywords": ["Cricket", "VRCricket", "iBCricket", "VRBatting", "MetaverseCricket"], "long_description": "A sport with 2.5 billion fans worldwide is now in VR as iB Cricket (vSport). Walk into world-class stadiums, hear fans roar, and smash the ball out of the park\ud83d\udd25With realistic physics, you can learn and start playing in just 10 minutes, no prior experience needed!\ud83c\udfcf\n\nLoved by players from **40+ countries**, including both cricketing and non-cricketing nations. The game has seen over **1 billion balls** played and earned appreciation from **100+ world-class cricketers**\ud83c\udfcf\ud83d\udd25\n\n\n# **Explore the World of iB Cricket**\n\n**\ud83c\udfdf\ufe0f20+ Stadiums**: Feel the electric atmosphere as you make your debut on legendary grounds packed with cheering fans \ud83c\udf89\n\n**\ud83d\udcd6Campaign Mode**: Start in the backyard and rise to global stardom \ud83c\udf1f Unlock new stadiums and craft your legendary journey\n\n**\ud83e\udd1dPvP Mode**: Challenge friends, set smart field placements, bowl tactically, and dominate your opponents \ud83d\udcaa\n\n**\ud83c\udf0dCO-OP Mode**: Team up with a friend from anywhere in the world. Banter, bond, and chase targets together \ud83e\udd1c\ud83e\udd1b\n\n**\ud83c\udfcfNet Practice**: Train like a pro! Customize pace, swing, spin, line & length to master every shot \ud83e\udde0\n\n**\u23f1\ufe0fMultiple Formats**: 20, 50 overs & unlimited overs\n\n**\ud83c\udfc6Leagues & Tournaments**: Feel the pressure, chase glory\n\n**\ud83e\udd16AI Coaching**: Improve technique with smart coaching\n\n**\u26beNumerous Bowling Options**: Right-arm & left-arm bowlers featuring fast, medium pace, off-spin, leg-spin, and more.\n\n**\ud83e\udde0Intelligent AI Fielding**: Realistic, dynamic gameplay\n\n**\ud83c\udfafVR Bowling**: Bowl short, good length or full and top the leaderboards\n\n**\ud83c\udfe0 Fun MR Games**: Bring cricket into your real world", "short_description": "A sport with 2.5 billion fans worldwide is now in VR as iB Cricket (vSport). Walk into world-class stadiums, hear fans roar, and smash the ball out of the park\ud83d\udd25Wi